    "description": "Mixed Mineral & Artifact Collection\nVarious Gemstones, Minerals, and Lithic Points\nAssorted Dimensions\nUnsigned / Ancient\nThis comprehensive lapidary and mineral collection features a diverse array of natural specimens, carved decorative objects, and ancient lithic artifacts. The lot includes six significant chert or flint projectile points (arrowheads) exhibiting characteristic knapping and varied patinas. Decorative elements include polished stone eggs, carved mushrooms in rose quartz and selenite, and faceted fluorite. The collection is anchored by large rough mineral specimens, including vibrant green malachite and a substantial selenite wand.\nFeatures a variety of gemstones including amethyst, rose quartz, tigers eye, and pyrite\nIncludes a selection of carved heart-shaped stone pendants with metal bails\nVariety of textures ranging from raw mineral clusters to highly polished decorative eggs\nCondition:\nOverall good condition. Natural mineral specimens show expected raw textures, inclusions, and fractures inherent to geological formations. Lithic artifacts show age-appropriate wear and typical knapping patterns. Carved and polished items are structurally sound with minor surface abrasions consistent with handling. Warehouse Location: Cleveland\nDue to our lighting, white glare lines may appear on items - This is NOT damage\nIf you have any questions regarding the quality or authenticity of this item or general questions regarding and item, please click Contact Seller on the item page and send us a message. We are available to answer your questions Monday through Friday, 8 am - 3:00 pm, EST.\n* For combined shipping policy see the shipping tab.\nSome items may contain unseen flaws not noted in the description.\nSee Photos. Items sold as-is.",
